---
description: Ban em dashes and double-hyphen dash punctuation in all FitMunch copy
alwaysApply: true
---

# No em dashes

Never use em dashes (`—`) or double-hyphen dash punctuation (` -- `) in:

- Customer emails, in-app copy, marketing pages, App Store text
- Discord/team messages about FitMunch
- Chat replies to Drew about FitMunch

Use commas, periods, colons, or parentheses instead.

CSS custom properties like `var(--green)` are fine. Do not replace those.
